00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:49.160
useful week for developers shipping production agents. Metacomp launches the world's first AI

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:55.220
agent governance framework for regulated financial services. The framework delivers structured policies,

00:00:55.220 --> 00:01:00.340
audit trails, risk controls, and compliance tooling tailored to the strict requirements of

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:07.400
