compliance. Early indications show tighter integration with Adobe's existing data cloud and

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:19.740
Sensei AI services than what you get when bolting on third-party agent frameworks. CX and marketing

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:24.800
technologists should test the beta for orchestrated customer journeys that previously required heavy

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:31.380
orchestration code. Researchers released GeorepiVal, a new benchmark that exposes up to 14 percentage

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:36.780
point accuracy gaps when the same geometry problem is presented in Euclidean, coordinate, or vector

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:42.380
form. Vector formulations proved especially brittle even after controlling for length and symbolic

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:48.700
complexity. A convert then solved prompt intervention recovered up to 52 points for high capacity models,

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:54.400
but smaller models showed no benefit. Teams building math or STEM tutoring agents should test their

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:59.660
current models across these parallel representations before claiming robust geometric reasoning.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:05.460
A new framework called Hallou SAE models hallucination as a phase transition in the latent space.

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:11.160
It uses sparse auto encoders to locate high energy critical zones and contrastive

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:17.260
logic attribution to pinpoint responsible features. On Gemma 2-9B, it delivers state-of-the-art

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:22.780
detection performance by treating generation as a trajectory through a potential energy landscape.

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:27.700
The approach offers more mechanistic insight than surface level uncertainty metrics.

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:34.180
Anyone shipping LLM applications where factual accuracy is non-negotiable should evaluate this

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:40.400
detection pipeline. PineLab's CTO argues that persistent verifiable identity is the critical

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:46.520
missing primitive for safe agent deployment at scale. Without stable identity, auditability,

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:51.980
credential delegation, and trust propagation across multi-agent workflows remain unsolved.

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:56.760
The piece frames identity as a foundational governance layer rather than an afterthought.

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:02.380
Builders of long-running or cross-organization agent systems should begin experimenting with

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:10.220
decentralized identity protocols or enterprise IAM extensions now. Coinbase backed X402 launched

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:16.500
agentech.market, a marketplace that lets developers discover, purchase, and compose paid AI agent

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:22.680
services with built-in payment rails. Backed by Coinbase, the platform aims to turn individual agent

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:29.060
capabilities into monetizable microservices with early focus on transactional and financial workflows.

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:34.580
Developers building compound agent systems can start browsing available services today

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:38.900
