00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:54.080
The article highlights emerging patterns around tool-calling reliability,

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:59.560
human-in-the-loop escalation, and integration with existing legal practice management platforms.

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:05.180
Law firms and legal tech developers should pilot agentech playbooks on narrow, high-volume tasks

