00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:18.880
open-code racing game comparison that pits Quinn 3.6-35b, Quinn 3.5 variants,

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:25.760
Gemma 4 models, and GLM 4.7 flash against each other on iterative game code generation using

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:32.700
